WEBVTT

00:04.129 --> 00:07.215
In the year 850, Trost District.

00:07.882 --> 00:11.928
The sight of Eren Jaeger triggering
his mysterious Titan ability

00:12.595 --> 00:16.891
was more than enough to strike terror
into the hearts of his fellow soldiers.

00:18.977 --> 00:20.645
I am

00:20.979 --> 00:22.522
a human!

00:23.398 --> 00:25.316
He is not an enemy of humanity!

00:26.568 --> 00:28.069
For humanity's glory,

00:28.737 --> 00:31.031
in what little time I have left to live,

00:31.114 --> 00:33.950
I will continue to advocate
for his strategic value!

00:37.954 --> 00:41.541
As Eren and his friends desperately
pleaded, only one man spoke up for them.

00:42.417 --> 00:43.710
Dot Pyxis.

00:44.753 --> 00:47.380
The top officer in charge
of the entire southern territory.

00:49.466 --> 00:54.137
Something tells me we ought
to hear these people out, you see.

02:34.487 --> 02:35.405
I'll do it!

02:35.780 --> 02:37.949
I don't know
if I can plug the hole or not!

02:38.533 --> 02:39.450
But...

02:40.160 --> 02:41.119
I'll do it!

02:45.582 --> 02:48.418
Well said! You're a real man!

02:52.046 --> 02:54.799
Calling all officers!
We have a plan to put together!

02:55.466 --> 02:56.718
You can't be serious!

02:56.801 --> 03:00.138
It was just some half-baked plan
I came up with on the spot!

03:00.221 --> 03:01.639
We're actually going through with it?

03:02.223 --> 03:03.725
That's what I thought too,

03:04.142 --> 03:07.061
but there's no point
in doubting his decision.

03:07.937 --> 03:12.150
Commander Pyxis must be envisioning
something that we can't see yet.

03:12.233 --> 03:13.735
Something we can't see yet?

03:14.235 --> 03:17.447
Plus, I think there's a bigger issue
that needs to be addressed

03:17.530 --> 03:19.324
before we can carry out the plan.

03:19.949 --> 03:22.952
And the Commander is keenly aware of it.

03:23.745 --> 03:24.704
What would that be?

03:25.330 --> 03:27.790
The Titans aren't the only enemy.

03:29.125 --> 03:30.710
Time is of the essence.

03:35.006 --> 03:39.052
We're counting on you, young soldiers.

03:52.857 --> 03:55.068
An operation to retake Trost?

03:55.151 --> 03:58.529
They can't be serious! We have
no way to plug that hole in the gate!

03:58.613 --> 04:00.323
What is the top brass thinking?

04:00.406 --> 04:02.408
Setting foot in Trost
means a pointless death!

04:02.492 --> 04:03.868
Since we can't block the hole,

04:03.952 --> 04:06.663
defending Wall Rose's gate
is our only real option now!

04:06.746 --> 04:09.707
Damn it! They want the glory that bad?

04:11.376 --> 04:13.878
Back into that hell again?

04:15.755 --> 04:17.632
No! I don't want to die!

04:17.715 --> 04:19.759
Let me see my family!

04:19.842 --> 04:21.344
Hey, Daz! Not so loud!

04:21.427 --> 04:23.763
You, there! I heard that!

04:23.846 --> 04:26.266
Do you intend to abandon your duty?

04:26.349 --> 04:27.600
Yes, I do!

04:27.684 --> 04:31.562
There's nothing to gain
from this pointless act of mass suicide!

04:32.105 --> 04:35.650
What do you take humanity for?
What about the rules?

04:36.234 --> 04:39.570
It's within my authority to execute you
on the spot, you know!

04:39.862 --> 04:41.447
That's fine by me!

04:41.990 --> 04:45.326
It's a hundred times better
than getting eaten by Titans!

04:45.410 --> 04:46.577
Stop, Daz!

04:46.661 --> 04:48.871
Stop! Let go!

04:48.955 --> 04:51.374
I refuse to go back to that hellhole!

04:52.709 --> 04:54.043
Did you hear that?

04:54.127 --> 04:56.337
I can't say I blame him.

04:56.921 --> 05:00.300
Hey, do you think
any of us will become traitors too?

05:00.383 --> 05:03.177
I wish I could choose how I die.

05:03.261 --> 05:04.637
You two!

05:04.721 --> 05:06.681
I didn't mean it.

05:06.764 --> 05:08.391
- Do it!
- What?

05:08.474 --> 05:12.186
Make a scene!
Get others involed too if possible!

05:12.729 --> 05:16.149
Many of us in the Garrison Regiment
are unhappy about this too!

05:16.232 --> 05:19.068
I'll use the commotion to get out of here!

05:19.152 --> 05:21.571
To escape and go where?

05:22.280 --> 05:24.532
To see my daughter!

05:25.074 --> 05:27.660
They're going to
break through this wall anyway!

05:29.746 --> 05:32.165
It's said that
before the Titans ruled the land,

05:32.248 --> 05:35.376
mankind is comprised of people
of different races and creeds,

05:35.460 --> 05:39.422
and that they perpetually fought with
and killed each other.

05:40.548 --> 05:42.967
Supposedly, someone back then said

05:43.051 --> 05:46.888
that if a powerful enemy
that wasn't human ever appeared,

05:46.971 --> 05:51.017
humanity would likely cease
its fighting and come together as one.

05:52.310 --> 05:54.103
What is your opinion?

05:54.562 --> 05:56.814
I'd never heard that story before.

05:56.898 --> 06:01.611
It's a pretty laid-back attitude.
It's enough to make me yawn.

06:03.446 --> 06:07.116
You have a twisted mind, just like me.

06:07.200 --> 06:11.329
Even now, when a powerful enemy
has driven us into a corner,

06:11.621 --> 06:14.874
I would hardly say
that we've "come together."

06:15.416 --> 06:16.626
Indeed.

06:16.709 --> 06:21.547
If we don't get our act together soon,
even fighting will be tough.

06:29.388 --> 06:30.598
Eren?

06:31.599 --> 06:33.101
He's all right.

06:35.269 --> 06:37.772
Focus on my work?

06:37.855 --> 06:41.317
Who does that punk think he is?
Why is he bossing a superior officer?

06:41.400 --> 06:45.279
Judging from his attitude,
Mikasa and Armin must be okay too.

06:46.322 --> 06:47.615
Still...

06:47.698 --> 06:50.701
Why is he with the Commander?

06:57.875 --> 06:59.418
Would you like some?

06:59.710 --> 07:01.379
Thank you, sir!

07:09.971 --> 07:13.099
Kill me! If you're going to
execute me, just do it already!

07:13.182 --> 07:14.976
All right! Let's do it!

07:21.983 --> 07:24.485
Attention!

07:30.992 --> 07:35.413
I will now explain to you the details
of the Trost Recovery Operation!

07:36.080 --> 07:38.624
The objective of this operation

07:38.708 --> 07:43.129
is to seal the hole
in the demolished gate!

07:48.009 --> 07:51.095
Seal it? How?

07:51.762 --> 07:53.681
As for how we'll accomplish this,

07:53.973 --> 07:56.809
let me start by introducing this fellow!

07:57.185 --> 08:00.771
This is Eren Jaeger,
a member of the Cadets!

08:02.857 --> 08:04.108
Eren?

08:04.984 --> 08:07.904
He is a successful result

08:07.987 --> 08:10.907
of our top-secret Titan
transformation experiments!

08:11.324 --> 08:17.163
He is able to form a Titan's body
and control it at will!

08:19.874 --> 08:23.044
The Commander isn't making much sense.

08:23.127 --> 08:25.421
It's not just because I'm stupid, right?

08:25.505 --> 08:28.341
Just be quiet. You idiot.

08:28.841 --> 08:33.804
In Titan form, he will lift
that giant rock near the front gate,

08:33.888 --> 08:37.934
carry it to the wrecked gate,
and seal the hole!

08:38.935 --> 08:40.394
As for you,

08:41.312 --> 08:46.692
you will defend him from the other Titans
while he carries the rock!

08:47.401 --> 08:49.362
There's no need to fight the Titans?

08:49.946 --> 08:52.949
I'm sorry! I didn't mean to interrupt!

08:53.032 --> 08:54.283
I know I'm just a cadet.

08:54.367 --> 08:56.827
That's okay. Continue.

08:57.286 --> 08:58.412
Right.

08:58.496 --> 09:02.542
Normally, Titans respond to large groups
of people by pursuing them.

09:03.209 --> 09:07.630
So if we were to use a large group
to lure them to the edge of the wall,

09:07.713 --> 09:13.302
I believe we could draw the Titans away
from Eren without having to fight.

09:13.386 --> 09:15.763
Additionally, once these
Titans have been lured away,

09:15.846 --> 09:19.225
we could take them out with cannons
without incurring any casualties

09:19.725 --> 09:23.563
However, we can't afford
to leave Eren defenseless,

09:23.646 --> 09:26.732
so a small squad of elite soldiers
would need to go and protect him.

09:27.149 --> 09:31.779
Plus, there's no avoiding any Titans
that come through the hole.

09:31.862 --> 09:34.532
The elite squad must be able
to handle them.

09:34.615 --> 09:37.868
All right then.
We'll rethink the plan around that.

09:38.369 --> 09:42.373
However, this is all
based on the assumption

09:42.456 --> 09:44.542
that Eren can pick up
the rock and seal the hole.

09:45.126 --> 09:48.754
I must admit I have my doubts
about carrying out this plan

09:48.838 --> 09:51.382
with so little assurance to go on.

09:51.465 --> 09:56.971
Indeed, I have misgivings about sending
so many people to their deaths

09:57.054 --> 09:58.764
based entirely on one big "if,"

09:59.390 --> 10:02.184
but I understand
Commander Pyxis' assessment too.

10:02.268 --> 10:04.895
Yes. One of the issues is time.

10:05.521 --> 10:08.899
As we speak, Titans continue
to pour into the town.

10:09.400 --> 10:11.986
The more Titans get in,

10:12.069 --> 10:15.156
the worse our chances become.

10:15.239 --> 10:19.910
And the chances of them
breaking through Wall Rose go up too.

10:20.536 --> 10:22.538
And there's one other issue.

10:23.873 --> 10:28.377
People can only be
driven by fear for so long.

10:31.255 --> 10:33.090
He's going to pick up that humongous rock?

10:33.799 --> 10:35.092
Is that really possible?

10:35.593 --> 10:38.304
Has mankind finally surmounted the Titans?

10:38.387 --> 10:39.930
You're lying!

10:40.014 --> 10:43.351
I refuse to give my life
for this ridiculous nonsense!

10:43.434 --> 10:46.062
What do you take us for?

10:46.145 --> 10:49.482
We're not disposable blades, you know!

10:49.940 --> 10:53.194
- He says he's a human weapon!
- He's obviously just lying!

10:53.277 --> 10:54.320
Do you take us for a fool?

10:54.403 --> 10:57.365
I am not going to die here today!
I'm out of here!

11:01.285 --> 11:02.203
Me too!

11:02.286 --> 11:03.746
Me too!

11:03.829 --> 11:05.247
Count me out, too!

11:05.331 --> 11:08.084
Wait! Don't make me execute you!

11:08.834 --> 11:11.879
I'm going to spend
humanity's final moments with my family!

11:12.713 --> 11:14.173
This isn't good.

11:15.174 --> 11:17.176
Indeed. We'll lose all order
if we don't do something.

11:18.386 --> 11:20.971
Prepare yourselves, lousy traitors!

11:21.055 --> 11:23.557
I'll cut you down where you stand!

11:25.142 --> 11:26.644
By my order,

11:27.311 --> 11:30.648
those who will leave now
are absolved of their crime!

11:32.441 --> 11:35.027
Those who have succumbed
to the Titans' terror once before

11:35.111 --> 11:36.987
can never face them again!

11:37.822 --> 11:41.617
Anyone who has already experienced
their horror may leave!

11:42.618 --> 11:47.832
And those who want
their family and loved ones

11:47.915 --> 11:50.960
to experience that same horror

11:51.043 --> 11:52.837
may leave as well!

12:00.761 --> 12:02.388
Daddy!

12:03.889 --> 12:05.766
Anything but that.

12:06.892 --> 12:08.519
My daughter is

12:10.813 --> 12:13.899
all the hope I have left!

12:16.026 --> 12:18.404
Let's discuss what we did four years ago!

12:19.196 --> 12:22.158
The operation to retake Wall Maria!

12:22.241 --> 12:25.828
I'm sure none of that needs explaining!

12:26.579 --> 12:29.206
Calling it a recovery operation
gave it a nice ring,

12:29.290 --> 12:33.711
but it was essentially a way to
dispose of the unemployed masses

12:33.794 --> 12:35.671
that the government couldn't support!

12:37.047 --> 12:40.217
The reason no one has spoken out about it

12:40.301 --> 12:43.304
is because sending them outside

12:43.387 --> 12:47.308
is what has allowed us to survive
inside these cramped walls!

12:51.520 --> 12:54.982
Everyone, including myself, is guilty!

12:55.649 --> 12:58.736
Conflict never arose

12:58.819 --> 13:01.113
simply because Wall Maria's citizens
were in the minority!

13:01.822 --> 13:03.532
But what about now?

13:04.366 --> 13:06.619
If Wall Rose falls,

13:06.702 --> 13:10.039
humanity will lose more than 20 percent
of its population!

13:11.582 --> 13:16.670
Wall Sina wouldn't be able to support
even half of the people still alive!

13:17.296 --> 13:22.551
If we humans go extinct, it won't be
because we were eaten by Titans!

13:23.552 --> 13:26.472
It will be because
we killed ourselves off!

13:27.932 --> 13:31.101
We cannot afford to die
any further inside.

13:32.478 --> 13:34.063
I kindly ask of you!

13:34.897 --> 13:36.524
Please die here!

13:44.615 --> 13:49.453
I don't know if I can lift that rock
with my Titan ability or not.

13:50.120 --> 13:53.290
But I understand what my role is.

13:54.250 --> 13:59.880
Even if I am uncertain about this,
I have to succeed.

14:01.465 --> 14:04.426
I have to serve

14:05.886 --> 14:08.847
as everyone's hope!

14:13.852 --> 14:15.437
Looks like you're all here.

14:15.521 --> 14:17.898
You only have one mission,

14:18.274 --> 14:20.317
which is to protect Eren Jaeger

14:20.734 --> 14:23.821
and eliminate any risks
that may arise during the operation.

14:24.655 --> 14:27.157
It will probably be
the most dangerous and difficult mission

14:27.241 --> 14:29.034
of the entire operation.

14:29.577 --> 14:33.789
It's not an exaggeration to say
that how you act out there

14:33.873 --> 14:35.958
will decide the fate of all mankind.

14:36.292 --> 14:38.711
Sir. May I ask a question?

14:39.086 --> 14:40.087
What is it?

14:40.504 --> 14:44.174
Are you really sure about
this human weapon of yours?

14:44.258 --> 14:45.426
Quit it, Rico.

14:45.509 --> 14:47.428
You have your doubts too, don't you?

14:48.387 --> 14:49.346
Sir.

14:49.430 --> 14:54.435
This plan is based on the incredible
uncertainty that is Eren Jaeger.

14:54.977 --> 14:58.856
If he fails to do it as planned,
many soldiers will die for nothing!

15:00.482 --> 15:01.984
Troubling, indeed.

15:02.067 --> 15:05.070
Are you that fond of losing to the Titans?

15:07.072 --> 15:08.741
Personally, I hate it.

15:08.824 --> 15:11.452
I hate losing more than anything else.

15:12.620 --> 15:17.124
But astonishingly enough, all my life,
I've been on the losing side.

15:20.044 --> 15:22.296
I want to win against the Titans.

15:22.922 --> 15:27.551
I want to prevail over those oafs,
no matter what it takes.

15:27.635 --> 15:30.387
No, we feel the same way, sir!

15:31.347 --> 15:33.933
Then the only option is
to take a gamble on him.

15:34.016 --> 15:37.728
Because what you call
"an incredible uncertainty"

15:38.270 --> 15:41.899
is our one and only chance
of achieving victory over the Titans.

15:43.817 --> 15:46.862
Sir, it's time
for the decoy operation to begin.

15:46.946 --> 15:48.364
Okay.

15:49.365 --> 15:50.908
Ian Dietrich.

15:51.450 --> 15:52.743
Rico Brzenska.

15:53.202 --> 15:54.411
Mitabi Jarnach.

15:54.912 --> 15:59.124
You are the very best of the top soldiers
of the Garrison Regiment.

16:00.000 --> 16:02.503
The fate of humanity is in your hands.

16:02.962 --> 16:04.254
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

16:04.338 --> 16:06.966
Ian. You'll lead the squad.

16:07.549 --> 16:09.927
I leave all on-site
decision-making to you.

16:11.053 --> 16:13.263
To me, sir?

16:13.347 --> 16:15.641
- I have no objections.
- Neither do I.

16:15.975 --> 16:18.435
But sir, I don't feel competent enough!

16:18.519 --> 16:19.979
Never fear.

16:20.646 --> 16:22.773
You have an understanding of alcohol.

16:22.856 --> 16:23.774
Sir?

16:24.316 --> 16:27.903
You can discern
when a drink is good, bad, or both.

16:28.862 --> 16:30.114
So I leave it to you.

16:31.573 --> 16:33.075
Yes, sir!

16:33.867 --> 16:35.494
Eren. I'm sorry.

16:37.204 --> 16:41.166
I didn't mean to force all
the responsibility onto your shoulders.

16:41.250 --> 16:42.710
I told you before, remember?

16:43.252 --> 16:45.796
You have the ability
to make the right call.

16:46.422 --> 16:47.965
I have faith in that.

16:48.048 --> 16:51.260
- Eren. I really think I should--
- Don't even think of coming with me.

16:52.553 --> 16:54.972
They assigned you to the decoy squad.

16:55.055 --> 16:57.683
But I can't leave you all alone!

16:57.766 --> 16:58.934
It will happen again if--

16:59.018 --> 17:00.102
Enough, already!

17:00.811 --> 17:04.940
I told you before!
I'm not your little brother or your kid!

17:07.943 --> 17:08.986
- Ackermann.
- Yes?

17:09.862 --> 17:12.489
Join the elite squad
that will protect Jaeger.

17:13.991 --> 17:15.617
We'll need your skills.

17:16.577 --> 17:18.287
Let's go. It's time to begin!

17:20.914 --> 17:23.417
See you, Armin. Don't die, you hear?

17:23.500 --> 17:25.669
Yes. You too, Eren.

17:39.391 --> 17:41.727
He called you a top-secret human weapon,

17:41.810 --> 17:43.937
but as long as you can seal that hole,
I don't care!

17:44.021 --> 17:45.773
We'll protect you at all costs!

17:45.898 --> 17:47.024
We're counting on you!

17:47.441 --> 17:48.734
Right!

17:49.443 --> 17:51.278
Eren. Are you all right?

17:51.361 --> 17:52.863
Yes.

17:54.114 --> 17:56.742
- Eren.
- Seriously, I'm fine!

17:56.825 --> 17:59.328
I'm much better than
when we were surrounded!

17:59.411 --> 18:01.538
Quit playing house, Jaeger!

18:01.830 --> 18:03.415
It's not like that!

18:03.499 --> 18:05.876
I can't believe the fate of mankind rests

18:05.959 --> 18:08.587
rests in the hands
of a coddled brat like you.

18:10.380 --> 18:12.132
That's enough, all of you!

18:12.216 --> 18:14.093
We're almost to the shortest route
to the rock.

18:15.219 --> 18:17.846
I don't see any Titans in the area.

18:17.930 --> 18:20.224
Their decoy tactic must be working.

18:24.228 --> 18:27.397
Listen! All we have to do is
lure them into a corner of town!

18:27.731 --> 18:29.566
Avoid any unnecessary fighting!

18:32.069 --> 18:33.779
Just so you're aware, Jaeger.

18:35.697 --> 18:40.369
More than just a few soldiers
will likely die during this operation.

18:40.452 --> 18:42.121
And it's all for you.

18:43.956 --> 18:49.128
Our colleagues,
our seniors, and our juniors.

18:49.211 --> 18:52.381
They're prepared to die, of course.
They're soldiers after all.

18:53.382 --> 18:57.094
But they aren't faceless pawns.

19:00.139 --> 19:01.640
Steady!

19:05.102 --> 19:06.562
Not yet!

19:07.938 --> 19:09.106
Almost!

19:11.775 --> 19:13.026
Break away!

19:14.695 --> 19:20.325
They have names, families, hopes,
and dreams of their own.

19:20.409 --> 19:23.537
Alyosha. Dominic. Fine.

19:23.620 --> 19:26.790
Isabel. Ludwig. Martina.

19:26.874 --> 19:28.584
Guido. Hans.

19:28.667 --> 19:31.628
They're all real people, flesh, and blood.

19:32.963 --> 19:36.425
Some have been living under
the same roof since their cadet days.

19:36.967 --> 19:42.264
And many of these people
could end up dying for you today.

19:43.223 --> 19:48.437
It's your duty
to make sure their deaths aren't in vain,

19:49.062 --> 19:50.606
regardless of what happens.

19:51.899 --> 19:54.484
Keep that in your pampered mind

19:54.568 --> 19:57.571
and fulfill your duty
with dead seriousness.

19:58.155 --> 19:59.531
I will!

20:00.407 --> 20:04.119
I can do this! I will succeed!

20:07.789 --> 20:11.460
Not once has humanity
ever achieved victory over the Titans

20:11.543 --> 20:13.629
since they first appeared!

20:14.671 --> 20:16.590
For every step
the Titans have taken forward,

20:16.673 --> 20:21.345
humanity has continually been forced
to draw back and give up its territory!

20:22.012 --> 20:25.599
However, should this operation succeed,

20:25.682 --> 20:31.605
we could take back the land
that the Titans have taken away from us!

20:32.189 --> 20:34.483
This is the spot! Let's go!

20:36.109 --> 20:41.531
It will be the first time mankind
has achieved victory over the Titans!

20:52.542 --> 20:54.211
Green smoke shell sighted!

20:54.962 --> 20:57.464
Elite Squad has commenced operation!

20:59.091 --> 21:03.470
Indeed, it may seem extraordinarily small

21:03.553 --> 21:06.807
compared to what humanity
has given up so far.

21:07.975 --> 21:09.059
However,

21:09.142 --> 21:13.105
for mankind, that single, small step

21:13.188 --> 21:15.482
could be a big leap forward!

21:46.430 --> 21:48.432
In terms of body proportion,

21:49.099 --> 21:51.852
it's hard to believe
he'll be able to pick up that rock.

21:52.477 --> 21:56.648
But I'm sure Eren has the strength
to lead us forward.

22:04.698 --> 22:05.741
Eren?

23:43.213 --> 23:46.133
The Trost Recovery Operation has begun.

23:46.591 --> 23:48.969
As countless soldiers meet their deaths,

